# Overlay patches are byte-exact inputs to patch --fuzz=0. Two of them (0006,
# 0007) carry CRLF hunks because upstream stores the ZAPDTR/OTRExporter
# CMakeLists.txt files with CRLF; a core.autocrlf checkout that strips the CRs
# makes them unappliable (GitHub issue #1, part 3). Never convert them.
overlay/patches/*.patch -text
overlay/assets/*.patch -text
